---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import tile from '../assets/tile.svg?raw';
import { founder, breadcrumb } from '../lib/schema';

const principles = [
  'Say less. Let the work be the loud part.',
  'The games can be loud. The studio stays calm.',
  'No hype words, no invented numbers.',
  'Be honest about how things are made, including where AI helped.',
];
---

<Base title="About | Silent Thread" description="The origin of Silent Thread, the mark, and how the studio works." schema={[founder(), breadcrumb([{ name: 'About', path: '/about' }])]}>
  <section class="section about-head" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="label">About</p>
      <h1 id="about-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Made after hours.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose" data-reveal-group>
      <p>For years I built products for other companies. That was my main thread: the work everyone could see, with someone else's name on it.</p>
      <p>At night, on one machine, I kept building my own things. Small games, plugins, dev tools nobody asked for. That was the silent thread.</p>
      <p>In code, a background thread keeps working while the main program gets the attention. In nature, a silk thread is the line a spider drops on: almost invisible, strong enough to hold its weight.</p>
      <p>Silent Thread is that second thread becoming a studio.</p>
      <p class="sign">Esteban Estrada, founder</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mark" aria-labelledby="mark-title">
    <div class="mark-tile" set:html={tile} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="mark-copy">
      <p class="label sec-label" style="--drop:16vh" data-sec><span class="sec-thread" aria-hidden="true"></span>The mark</p>
      <h2 id="mark-title" class="h3" data-reveal>One line ending in a weight.</h2>
      <p>The mark is the silent thread. It hangs from the edge of whatever it lives on: a tile, a card, the top of a screen. In the wordmark it replaces the I of SILENT.</p>
      <p><a class="link" href="https://github.com/silentthreadstudio/brand" rel="noopener">Brand and design system <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <p class="label sec-label" style="--drop:16vh" data-sec><span class="sec-thread" aria-hidden="true"></span>How we work</p>
    <h2 id="principles-title" class="visually-hidden">How we work</h2>
    <ol>
      {principles.map((p) => <li data-principle>{p}</li>)}
    </ol>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  import { initMotion } from '../scripts/motion';
  initMotion();
</script>

<style>
  .about-head { padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 12vh); border-top: 0; }
  .sign { margin-top: 2rem !important; font: 400 0.78rem var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-3); }

  .mark { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 220px) minmax(0, 36rem); gap: 2rem 6vw; align-items: center; }
  .mark-tile { width: 100%; max-width: 220px; aspect-ratio: 1; border: 1px solid var(--surface); border-radius: 14%; }
  .mark-tile :global(svg) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .mark-copy { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .mark-copy p:not(.label) { margin: 0; color: var(--fg-3); font-size: 1.1rem; }

  .principles { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .principles ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; }
  .principles li {
    padding-block: 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface);
    font: 700 clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2.4rem)/1.15 var(--font-display); font-stretch: 112%; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .principles li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--surface); }
  :global(html.motion) .principles li { color: var(--fg-3); transition: color 0.5s var(--motion-ease); }
  :global(html.motion) .principles li.on { color: var(--fg); }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .mark { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .mark-tile { max-width: 140px; }
  }
</style>
